          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyini kiwonyö könyi kïset lïko koro Sirya kïpa kïporyeghö pipö Yerusalem nko cho pö Yuda. Kïpar yetïntine löwïr akïngatar tïkwïn cho chang ato löwïr kwipchï pöytoghinto Damaska. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kingörï pipö lïkononi pö sirya wölo kwigh ECHOTYON lïkononi kïrïnta lïko pipö Yuda nyo wow, ompöwölo kikipïstö chane ECHOTYON Tororöto papotïnekwa. Kïlenyona kïnyorï pöytoghintö Yoas sito ECHOTYON kuwerï lïko Sirya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
